*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0039
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-02-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-07 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 470
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0039.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> STUDENT INDICATOR Y/N
    05 STUDENT-FLAG       PIC X.
       88 STUDENT-STUDENT VALUE 'Y'.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 CLNT-AGE           PIC 9(3).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 FEE-WAIVED         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 MONTHLY-FEE        PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 2200-CONCESSIONS
    DISPLAY "FEE-WAIVED=" FEE-WAIVED
    DISPLAY "MONTHLY-FEE=" MONTHLY-FEE
    STOP RUN.
2200-CONCESSIONS.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> STUDENT FEE WAIVER
        WHEN STUDENT-STUDENT AND CLNT-AGE < 25
            MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVED
            MOVE 0 TO MONTHLY-FEE
        *> SENIOR FEE WAIVER
        WHEN CLNT-AGE >= 60
            MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVED
            MOVE 0 TO MONTHLY-FEE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 4 TO MONTHLY-FEE
    END-EVALUATE.
